  "steps": [
    "Toss tofu with 5 tbsp cornstarch and season with salt and pepper. Fry in oil until golden and crisp. Remove and set aside.",
    "<strong>Make Sauce:</strong> Whisk chilli oil, tamari, agave, rice vinegar, water, and remaining cornstarch in a small bowl.",
    "In the same pan, fry garlic and spring onion whites ~30 sec until fragrant.",
    "Add sauce mixture and cook until thickened.",
    "Return tofu to the pan and toss until evenly coated.",
    "Serve garnished with spring onion greens and sesame seeds."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Tearing tofu creates more craggy edges for extra crispiness.",
    "Serve with rice or noodles to soak up the sauce.",
    "Add extra chilli oil for more heat."
